{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/01_technology/01_client/c_c++/001_char* a 和 char *a 区别/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Vance’s Blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"7fcd30b8-349c-5d43-b1bc-fe1f487a71eb","excerpt":"在写 c++的时候发现有两种定义定义指针的方式 方式一 方式二 其实两者的写法都是可以的，但第一种写法不能同时定义两个指针，比如： 而第二种可以：","html":"<p>在写 c++的时候发现有两种定义定义指针的方式</p>\n<p>方式一</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"c\"><pre class=\"language-c\"><code class=\"language-c\"><span class=\"token keyword\">char</span><span class=\"token operator\">*</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>方式二</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"c\"><pre class=\"language-c\"><code class=\"language-c\"><span class=\"token keyword\">char</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>其实两者的写法都是可以的，但第一种写法不能同时定义两个指针，比如：</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"c\"><pre class=\"language-c\"><code class=\"language-c\"><span class=\"token comment\">// 以下的b不指针</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">char</span><span class=\"token operator\">*</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> b<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>而第二种可以：</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"c\"><pre class=\"language-c\"><code class=\"language-c\"><span class=\"token keyword\">char</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>","frontmatter":{"title":"char* a 和 char *a 区别","date":"2022-08-09","description":"char* a 和 char *a 区别"},"fields":{"slug":"/01_technology/01_client/c_c++/001_char* a 和 char *a 区别/","gitModifiedTime":"2024-02-25 22:46"}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/01_technology/01_client/web/008_webpack打包体积分析/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"webpack 分析项目打包体积"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/03_life/games/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"游戏专区"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"7fcd30b8-349c-5d43-b1bc-fe1f487a71eb","previousPostId":"b38cdb01-7208-5101-bb7e-2c96ee77949f","nextPostId":"1b0bb136-3063-53bc-8d97-1a063aa0c38c"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383","3257411868"]}